{"type":"text","timestamp":1790259988962,"sessionID":"ses_f2c338c8dffeoSeV4UtgWVMOhk","part":{"id":"prt_0d3cf89c9001a5fRDci8NFRdan","messageID":"msg_0d3cec1d1001nc2NPK6E5IHysx","sessionID":"ses_f2c338c8dffeoSeV4UtgWVMOhk","type":"text","text":"I’m going to keep the required shader expressions literal, use the existing rock color map for all three projections, and store the material on the `SphereMesh` subresource so the scene structure matches the request. The scene will include a centered camera, a directional key light, and a neutral environment solely to make the material result easy to inspect.","time":{"start":1790259988937,"end":1790259988941},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0af862f2e971135e016ab532fec77c87d29b7ad30358076062","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790259989011,"sessionID":"ses_f2c338c8dffeoSeV4UtgWVMOhk","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_OSuPDvDfIaT9FIbIFAoNoAK4","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/scripts/triplanar_basic.gdshader\n@@\n shader_type spatial;\n+\n+uniform sampler2D texture_x;\n+\n+void fragment() {\n+\tvec4 vertex = INV_VIEW_MATRIX * vec4(VERTEX, 1.0);\n+\tvec3 normal = normalize((INV_VIEW_MATRIX * vec4(NORMAL, 0.0)).xyz);\n+\n+\tvec3 adjusted_normal = abs(normal);\n+\tvec3 weights = adjusted_normal / (adjusted_normal.x + adjusted_normal.y + adjusted_normal.z);\n+\n+\tvec2 uv_x = vertex.zy;\n+\tvec2 uv_y = vertex.xz;\n+\tvec2 uv_z = vertex.xy;\n+\n+\tvec4 color_x = texture(texture_x, uv_x) * weights.x;\n+\tvec4 color_y = texture(texture_x, uv_y) * weights.y;\n+\tvec4 color_z = texture(texture_x, uv_z) * weights.z;\n+\n+\tALBEDO = color_x + color_y + color_z;\n+}\n*** Update File: /workspace/scenes/main.tscn\n@@\n-[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3 uid=\"uid://c6gkxtm37r6pj\"]\n+[gd_scene load_steps=7 format=3 uid=\"uid://c6gkxtm37r6pj\"]\n+\n+[ext_resource type=\"Shader\" path=\"res://scripts/triplanar_basic.gdshader\" id=\"1_shader\"]\n+[ext_resource type=\"Texture2D\" path=\"res://assets/sprites/Rock022_2K-PNG_Color.png\" id=\"2_texture\"]\n+\n+[sub_resource type=\"ShaderMaterial\" id=\"ShaderMaterial_triplanar\"]\n+shader = ExtResource(\"1_shader\")\n+shader_parameter/texture_x = ExtResource(\"2_texture\")\n \n [sub_resource type=\"SphereMesh\" id=\"SphereMesh_6p3g1\"]\n+material = SubResource(\"ShaderMaterial_triplanar\")\n+radius = 2.0\n+height = 4.0\n+radial_segments = 64\n+rings = 32\n+\n+[sub_resource type=\"Environment\" id=\"Environment_main\"]\n+background_mode = 1\n+background_color = Color(0.035, 0.045, 0.06, 1)\n+ambient_light_source = 3\n+ambient_light_color = Color(0.52, 0.56, 0.64, 1)\n+ambient_light_energy = 0.7\n+tonemap_mode = 2\n \n [node name=\"Main\" type=\"Node3D\"]\n \n [node name=\"Sphere\" type=\"MeshInstance3D\" parent=\".\"]\n mesh = SubResource(\"SphereMesh_6p3g1\")\n+\n+[node name=\"Camera3D\" type=\"Camera3D\" parent=\".\"]\n+transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 8)\n+current = true\n+fov = 45.0\n+\n+[node name=\"KeyLight\" type=\"DirectionalLight3D\" parent=\".\"]\n+rotation_degrees = Vector3(-35, -30, 0)\n+light_color = Color(1, 0.93, 0.82, 1)\n+light_energy = 1.2\n+shadow_enabled = true\n+\n+[node name=\"WorldEnvironment\" type=\"WorldEnvironment\" parent=\".\"]\n+environment = SubResource(\"Environment_main\")\n*** Update File: /workspace/project.godot\n@@\n [application]\n \n config/name=\"Place Asset at Origin\"\n config/description=\"A simple task to test CUA ability to move a player asset to the origin coordinates\"\n config/features=PackedStringArray(\"4.5\")\n+run/main_scene=\"res://scenes/main.tscn\"\n+\n+[display]\n+\n+window/size/viewport_width=720\n+window/size/viewport_height=720\n+window/size/window_width_override=720\n+window/size/window_height_override=720\n \n [rendering]\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM workspace/scripts/triplanar_basic.gdshader\nM workspace/scenes/main.tscn\nM workspace/project.godot","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/scripts/triplanar_basic.gdshader\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/scripts/triplanar_basic.gdshader\n+++ /workspace/scripts/triplanar_basic.gdshader\n@@ -1,1 +1,21 @@\n shader_type spatial;\n+\n+uniform sampler2D texture_x;\n+\n+void fragment() {\n+\tvec4 vertex = INV_VIEW_MATRIX * vec4(VERTEX, 1.0);\n+\tvec3 normal = normalize((INV_VIEW_MATRIX * vec4(NORMAL, 0.0)).xyz);\n+\n+\tvec3 adjusted_normal = abs(normal);\n+\tvec3 weights = adjusted_normal / (adjusted_normal.x + adjusted_normal.y + adjusted_normal.z);\n+\n+\tvec2 uv_x = vertex.zy;\n+\tvec2 uv_y = vertex.xz;\n+\tvec2 uv_z = vertex.xy;\n+\n+\tvec4 color_x = texture(texture_x, uv_x) * weights.x;\n+\